1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Interrogator: You were specifically told to hold, but you didn't. Why?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Sgt. Kellar: Charlie team was down. I wasn't gonna let this guy get away.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Sgt. Kellar: The first floor was clear.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Sgt. Kellar: I heard movement above.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Sgt. Kellar: I made my way up, and that's when I saw him.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Sgt. Kellar: The fourth guy? Yeah, the fourth guy.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Interrogator: The after-action report you filed states he got the drop on you.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Interrogator: But he didn't fire. Why?

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Sgt. Kellar: He was American. Not Russian, not German, not Chechen.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Interrogator: Interesting. How do you know that?

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Sgt. Kellar: He spoke to me.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Interrogator: What did this American say to you?

13
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Sgt. Kellar: I can't remember. An RPG hit the building. Everything's blank after that.

14
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Interrogator: What was your next assignment? A double-header:

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Sgt. Kellar: Destroy the Seventh Wave weapons cache and stronghold at Naszran.

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Interrogator: You were ordered to RV with Lieutenant McCarver en route to the objective?

17
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Sgt. Kellar: Yes. It would've been easy if the maps and the intel on the border crossing weren't out of date.

18
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Sgt. Kellar: The only thing right about it was the farm.
